Bind every offered relay, so a phone caller is heard after accept.

Origin: purpshell/meowcaller#26, head 3494d987fa8df585697e09c7fb0541eaff81c2c3,
https://github.com/purpshell/meowcaller/pull/26 (open when taken, on 2026-10-07).

Why: without it, an inbound call accepted from the connector carries no audio from
the caller's phone; with it, audio and video flow both ways on our whatsmeow pin.
Measured in fazer-ai/whatsapp-connector#235. Remove this patch once the pull request
is merged upstream and the pin moves past it.

